te.\nBut first, you must endure a disturbing journey through a cursed place filled with secrets, darkness, and unsettling trials.", "summary": "Immerse yourself in a first-person psychological horror experience where every choice matters. Explore a cursed environment shaped by echoes of the past, uncover hidden truths, and reconstruct fragments of a forgotten story.\n\nAs you progress, your decisions and interactions will influence the outcome, leading to multiple possible endings. Solve observation-based puzzles, interpret subtle clues, and confront the unsettling presence that lingers in the environment.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/echoes--9", "videos": [{"id": 179696, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "jyJ4eAyQZdI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jyJ4eAyQZdI", "title": "Psychological Horror Game \u2013 Echoes (Official Trailer)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jyJ4eAyQZdI/fhddefault.jpg"}]}